  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Find OD Voice in ATAK's settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap ATAK's menu at the top right, then Settings, Tool Preferences and <strong>Specific Tool Preferences</strong>. Scroll down and tap <strong>OD Voice Preferences</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d9f96544ebce8973.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See the settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The pane's settings are here too, under <strong>CONNECTION</strong>, <strong>PTT DEVICE</strong>, <strong>TRANSMIT</strong> and <strong>VOICE ACTIVATION</strong>. A change here works at once, as in the pane.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/56567fc48d2321c6.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a PTT button here",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>PTT device</strong> opens a page of its own. Tap <strong>Scan for PTT devices</strong>, then tap your button under <strong>FOUND DEVICES</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/380ccb8f0d529014.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set VOX sensitivity",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Go back and scroll down. Tap <strong>VOX sensitivity</strong> to open a slider, then <strong>OK</strong> to keep it or <strong>Default</strong> for the middle.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8beb384ecfd7b116.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the manual",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Under <strong>HELP</strong>, <strong>User manual</strong> opens the OD Voice manual in a PDF viewer.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ca8b8aa18be1a8ae.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
